 "name": "ST08MILITARY.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "There is a riddle of history.",
  "Why did Zeon's forces, latecomers",
  "with a short history, give",
  "the Federation such a hard fight?",
  "Most records",
  "put it down to the strength",
  "of the mobile suit Zaku.",
  "But seen on the grand scale,",
  "any new weapon can be expressed",
  "as a number: military strength.",
  "And since strength is built",
  "from national power, Zeon,",
  "with 1/50 the Federation's,",
  "should have been powerless",
  "against it.",
  "Even if Zeon turned national power",
  "into strength ten times as well,",
  "it could never rival the Federation.",
  "Apply the 3:1 rule of defense,",
  "if Zeon were the defender,",
  "it might put up a good fight.",
  "But Zeon was winning",
  "back when it was",
  "on the offensive.",
  "We must take it that",
  "Zeon's strength lay",
  "in neither numbers",
  "nor defense.",
  "In the Second World War,",
  "which Universal Century history",
  "counts as the Middle Century,",
  "Hitler's armies",
  "did something similar.",
  "The western blitzkrieg was one.",
  "Hitler's forces at the time,",
  "though outnumbered in tanks,",
  "massed them together,",
  "loading their strength in one place,",
  "and used that to break through.",
  "Concentration is the basis of war,",
  "but this",
  "the Earth Federation knew well",
  "and surely put into practice.",
  "To repeat:",
  "most history books and records",
  "do not say the Federation",
  "was incompetent.",
  "Not concentration, not numbers,",
  "not defense: what, then, was",
  "the strength of Zeon?",
  "What deserves attention, I think,",
  "is the war in space itself.",
  "The Power of the Space Dwellers",
  "Its Secret Name Was Musai",
  "The reason Zeon fought so well",
  "most likely lies in the fact",
  "that Zeon was a nation",
  "of the people of space.",
  "It is simple: the Earth Federation",
  "still bore the strong imprint",
  "of the days when everything",
  "began and ended on Earth,",
  "and almost none of its top brass",
  "had been born in space.",
  "Zeon claimed the Earth Federation",
  "existed for the sake of Earth",
  "(and that was its cause for war),",
  "and as such, it was not wrong.",
  "The scales of space and Earth",
  "differ enormously.",
  "In space, 380,000 km (Earth-Moon)",
  "is no great distance at all.",
  "But on Earth, that distance",
  "is likely beyond imagining.",
  "Just 40,000 km",
  "takes you once around the Earth.",
  "A soldier who misjudges distance",
  "is a byword for folly, but",
  "the hidden cause of it already",
  "lay on the Federation side.",
  "Every heavenly body keeps moving,",
  "so no single map will do;",
  "that is one example.",
  "Big or small, on Earth and in space",
  "nothing worked quite the same.",
  "What an Earth dweller does right",
  "by Earth's sense of things",
  "is not right in space.",
  "For example, a pay cut",
  "or losing one's job",
  "means death in space.",
  "Because even air",
  "has to be bought with money.",
  "AEUG would later come into being",
  "because, after the One Year War,",
  "the Earth Federation discharged",
  "and retired troops en masse.",
  "The discharged soldiers,",
  "to survive, joined AEUG",
  "and fought the Earth Federation.",
  "Nor did any people of space",
  "blame them for it.",
  "Even a single personnel decision,",
  "made by Earth's sense of things,",
  "could breed mass betrayal.",
  "In the end, these gaps piling up",
  "became the difference in results",
  "early in the war, I suspect.",
  "What deserves attention",
  "is the cruiser known",
  "as the \"Musai.\"",
  "This light ship, rushed out for war,",
  "was a desperate expedient, built",
  "because Zeon lacked enough",
  "large docks.",
  "Its style, combining that distinctive",
  "engine block, the living block,",
  "weapons block, command post",
  "and hangar block,",
  "shows it was built block by block",
  "and only later",
  "(floated into place, being in space)",
  "joined together.",
  "The rush-built Pegasus class,",
  "in other words White Base,",
  "shares the same design.",
  "This method of building",
  "suited mass production",
  "and was ideal for Zeon,",
  "a small nation,",
  "but as a gunship it ran",
  "a dangerously high risk of failure.",
  "Joining blocks meant that",
  "any imprecision in the joins",
  "caused slight misalignments,",
  "which, for the guns,",
  "showed in long-range gunnery",
  "as a marked drop in accuracy.",
  "Though poor for mass production,",
  "the old cigar-shaped Magellan,",
  "Salamis, Chivvay and Zanzibar",
  "were built all the same,",
  "and for good reason.",
  "But for the Musai,",
  "gunnery was not what mattered.",
  "Indeed, later mass-produced ships",
  "cut their guns back even further.",
  "And yet it did splendidly.",
  "For the Musai,",
  "its weapon and striking power",
  "lay not in the Musai itself",
  "but in the Zakus",
  "that it carried.",
  "The Musai was the first ship",
  "conceived from the start",
  "to operate as a set with Zakus,",
  "and that, in the end, is what",
  "sealed Zeon's early victories.",
  "Mobile weapons, on long voyages,",
  "were dead weight (useless mass):",
  "so thinking,",
  "the Federation, which stuck to",
  "long-range gunnery, ended up",
  "fighting Zeon with fleets that",
  "could not even operate Saberfish.",
  "A new weapon, the mobile suit,",
  "had appeared, and Zeon kept",
  "piling up early victories, yet",
  "even so, the Federation Forces",
  "could not break free",
  "of the old way of fighting.",
  "There was not even enough time",
  "to prepare other tactics.",
  "They had massed a great fleet",
  "for a decisive blow, yet even it",
  "had been crushed.",
  "The Federation space forces",
  "were in ruins, and the fighting",
  "had become a fighting withdrawal.",
  "Once more, the stalling worked.",
  "The Federation space forces",
  "escaped collapse, pulled back,",
  "and tightened their defense line.",
  "There was no defense line",
  "behind this one.",
  "Behind it",
  "lay Mother Earth.",
  "And against that Mother Earth,",
  "Zeon was preparing",
  "a decisive attack..."
 ]
}
